        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Microsoft Entertainment Pack was a pack of simple casual games released in 1990. At the time it was one of the first Windows only PC games on the market.\n\nMicrosoft Entertainment Pack: The Puzzle Collection features ten new puzzle games, designed by Alexei Pajitnov, the creator of Tetris. The puzzle games are:\n- Fringer\n- Finty Flush\n- Mixed Genetics\n- Rat Poker\n- Lineup\n- Jewel Chase\n- Color Collision\n- Charmer\n- Spring Weekend\n- Muddled Casino",
